WEBVTT

00:00:00.468 --> 00:00:03.809
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> When I was a child <b>I used to</b> play in the streets.

00:00:05.896 --> 00:00:09.854
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> My brother <b>used to</b> have very long hair when he was a student.

00:00:11.917 --> 00:00:16.124
Nick didn’t <b>use to</b> go out much, but now he goes out every night.

00:00:18.155 --> 00:00:22.258
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> I didn’t <b>use to</b> like vegetables, but now I love them.

00:00:24.258 --> 00:00:26.549
<v><b>A:</b></v><b> Did</b> you <b>use to</b> wear a uniform at school?

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:28.830
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, I did.

00:00:29.695 --> 00:00:31.695
<v><b>A:</b></v><b> Did</b> you <b>use to</b> like your teachers?

00:00:32.417 --> 00:00:34.417
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, I didn’t.